## Website Goals and Objectives

The main goal of Skolify is to help matric learners find useful information about universities, courses, applications and funding opportunities in one website. The website is designed to make the university search process easier and more understandable for learners.

The objectives of the website are to provide clear information, create simple navigation between pages, provide an enquiry form for questions, and provide contact and location information.

## Key Features and Functionality

* Five linked HTML pages
* Home page with an introduction to Skolify
* About Us page explaining the organisation, mission, vision and learners it helps
* Universities and Courses page with university, course, application and funding information
* Enquiry page with an enquiry form
* Contact page with contact information, a contact form and location information
* Consistent navigation menu across all pages
* External CSS styling
* JavaScript functionality
* Responsive page structure for different screen sizes

